# Environment variables — web

Example files in `web/.config/`: `.env.example`, `.env.ci.example`, `.env.test.example`.
Copy to repo root as `.env`.

## App

| Variable | Example | Description |
|----------|---------|-------------|
| `APP_ENV` | `local` | `local` / `production` / `testing` |
| `NUXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL` | `http://localhost:3000` | Public app URL |
| `SSR` | `true` | Server-side rendering |
| `NITRO_PRESET` | `cloudflare` | Deployment preset |
| `PRERENDER_ROUTES` | `/en/home` | Comma-separated prerender routes |

## Supabase

| Variable | Description |
|----------|-------------|
| `SUPABASE_URL` | Project URL |
| `SUPABASE_KEY` | Anon key (client-safe) |
| `SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY` | Service key — **server only** |

## Submodules

| Variable | Example | Description |
|----------|---------|-------------|
| `NUC_SUBMODULES_BRANCH` | `main` | Branch for prepare-submodules |
| `NUC_SUBMODULES_CHECK` | `1` | Skip existing dirs |
